# Biome Seven's root room (CIPlay biome_seven_caves, 11-08). Run it in a new world whose name does NOT start with 'CI '
# (e.g. 'W03 bscaves'): in a 'CI ' world each `island` line empties the inventory and Brinelab's machete is lost on the
# way. Points as in its recipe (11-08 w03; heights over the island's own water line, all 18 m under the sea): the vine
# mouth at -62 -4 on the seabed west of the dome, the straight service tunnel east to the root room round -30 -4 (air
# zone bs_rootroom, mushrooms, dirt, lamps). The machete comes from Brinelab Tower's reception drawer, as in the plan.
# Shut by the vines, cut, swum in, air taken, swum back out.
island Brinelab Tower
offset 0.978 2.1699
open Reception drawer
wait 3
expect item Machete 1

island Biome Seven
offset 0.5706 0.0209
hour 11
weather Calm
where ChoppableVines
where Pickup_Landmark_Mushroom
where Pickup_Landmark_DirtPickup

# The mouth on the seabed: shut by the vines
picture bs_cave_out -72 5 -4 -62 4 -4
walk -70 -4 to -64 -4 to -56 -4 blocked
expect shown bsroot_vines
use bsroot_vines
expect hidden bsroot_vines
picture bs_cave_cut -72 5 -4 -62 4 -4
# in to the root room, and breathe there
walk -70 -4 to -62 -4 to -50 -4 to -40 -4 to -30 -4
air bs_rootroom here
picture bs_cave_in -40 5 -4 -24 4 -4 light=20
picture bs_room_back -22 5 -4 -42 4 -4 light=20
air bs_rootroom
# back out to the seabed
# (11-09: out of the air room the way back is under water - a walk floated up to the cave roof; a swim keeps low)
swim -30 -4 4 to -40 -4 4 to -50 -4 4.2 to -62 -4 4.5 to -70 -4 4.5
